<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6836"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 3:35 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Pax - good post.  Very interesting. <BR> <BR>I think you are on to something.  One thing no one has ever satisfactorily answered for me is - where did the PD get the DNA?  I am begining to think they don&#39;t really have any. <BR> <BR>I think the swabbing is a psychological plan, intended to corner an unwary killer.    <BR> <BR>I would certainly like to be informed if someone knows information to the contrary.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
