<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7312"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Richerich<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Richerich<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 8:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thank you very much Pax and Freya. I appreciate the constructive criticsm. I will continue to post when my opinion is relevant to the posts written. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
