</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Catcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 16, 2005 - 5:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Does anyone else find it interesting that on 05 Feb, &#34;BTK&#34; posted -- west st.  And now the very next communication was mailed to the KSAS news station on West St.??????!!!!!!!  Either the poster is a phony and the communication to KSAS was a prankster &#40;maybe even the same person as the poster&#41;, or this is quite possible a little bit of verification that BTK is indeed communicating through the designated thread!  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
