</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 16, 2005 - 6:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Very intresting. If it is an imposter sending letters, then thats a dumb individual. Obstructing Justice???? Now if the new drop can be verified then we can strongly suspect he was posting. So the next question, what do the rest of the clues mean? Need some Scooby Snacks...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
