<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7638"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 16, 2005 - 9:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hypocritical? I don&#39;t even understand what that means in context with this thread. Hypocritical is...&#34;admittedly obnoxious but valid&#34;...huh? <BR> <BR>It wasn&#39;t even my post that I was defending. It was all of ours...the poster that got flamed wasn&#39;t contributing anything yet criticizing all of the posters here. <BR> <BR>Yikes. Either some didn&#39;t read the offending post - or didn&#39;t get the dripping sarcasm and offensive nuances. <BR> <BR>Good luck to you all. Hope you guys keep up the good work - I admire many of your good research and hard work. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7638-->
<!--Post: 7659--><!--Time: 1108646284-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7659"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Zenith<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Zenith<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 5:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I wonder sometimes if people only like to talk to people who agree with them. Let&#39;s agree to disagree as a means of stimulating further theories on BTK. RicheRich didn&#39;t do anything so bad, he had some interesting points to make. I&#39;d like to hear from him again, his point of view which is strictly evidence-based balances out some of the more &#34;out there&#34; theories. Balance is a good thing. <BR> <BR>Now onward, isn&#39;t it interesting that our friend BTK sent a package to a different station, news reports say the necklace inside does not match the necklace we&#39;ve been looking for. I thought we were going to hear from KAKE about the contents of the Post Toasties box last night. Disappointing. I do agree the West St. posting here by someone we&#39;ve assumed was a BTK imposter is very interesting now. Time to reread all those posts.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7659-->
<!--Post: 7660--><!--Time: 1108647219-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7660"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 5:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It´s a HUGE mystery to me that people don´t understand that the Richerich issu is NOT NOT NOT about agree/disagree or &#34;the freedom to speak once opinion&#34; <BR>The Richerich issue is about his DISRESPECT for other posters, and other posters backing him op in that, it is about the WAY he &#34;talk&#34; about/to the posters he disagree with THAT is the problem. It is not his opinion I have a problem with it is his WAY of stating it. <BR> <BR>And by the way, calling BTK &#34;our friend&#34; thats a thing I don´t understand either??? <BR> <BR>I´m sure several of the victims friends/relatives are reading thise forums, how do you think they feel when reading &#34;ouer friend BTK&#34;? <BR> <BR>maybee I am from another planet???<!--/Text--></td></tr>
