<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9398"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 12:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What about this poster Love of God who wanted to be chummy with BTK and was his &#34;friend in Christ&#39; and the Jesus Saves poster who wanted him to repent. Could these have been from BTK himself, or someone from his church, or his daughter?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
