<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9419"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 5:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Pax56 and Johmo <BR> <BR>Interesting to reread the post  _BTK_  posted  on AMW feb 19th. <BR> <BR>In the post he said that in 9 days , that would be feb 28th, newsmedia would tell us not to worry &#40;anymore?&#41;. <BR> <BR>Was this a message from BTK that he knew/planed? to get caught as we have now vitnessed? <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/10/536.html?1109362127" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/10/536.htm l?1109362127</a> <BR> <BR> <BR>Posted on Saturday, February 19, 2005 - 12:32 pm:      <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR> <BR>A poster asked him to tell what was in the cereal box:  <BR> <BR>From: __BTK__ 3:29 pm  <BR>To: Artist112 &#40;45 of 51&#41;  <BR> <BR>1738.45 in reply to 1738.42  <BR> <BR>a brick potting down on it and a note. I bet you in 1 week and 2 days from now your local news will tell you dont worry.  <BR> <BR> <BR>Options Reply  <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>  <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
