</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 1:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->SKOV: On the post by BTK_AMW about what was in the cereal box: &#34;a brick potting down on it and a note. I bet you in 1 week and 2 days from now your local news will tell you dont worry.&#34; <BR> <BR>I hate to have to tell you this, but he was WRONG! He didn&#39;t know that JEWELRY was also contained in that box. BIG MISTAKE! Also his timing was wrong.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
