</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 5:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Someone over at AMW&#39;s site has seemingly cracked the code left from the poster 440 on the messages from BTK thead here. <BR> <BR><a href="http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages/?msg=2599.1" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages/?msg=25 99.1</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
