<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10264"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 7:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->MESSAGES TO BTK: <BR> <BR>At least that thread is being used for it&#39;s intent 90% of the time. <BR> <BR>INTENT: To get off of your chest exactly what you&#39;d like to say to mr. dogcatcher if you had the opportunity. Everyone here who has invested emotionally in the victims, their families, the wonderful community of Wichita and each other has wanted to say something to that bastard.  <BR> <BR>That thread &#40;MSG TO BTK&#41; is where you do it. No judgement allowed. Its not meant to be right or wrong. Its a healthy place to get it out of your mind and allow you to go about being moms, dads, students, co-workers, etc. without this freak creeping into your thoughts.  <BR> <BR>The thoughts of what he did can poison your mind.  <BR> <BR>Disclaimer----Please don&#39;t call me names or accuse me of trying to be in charge. I am not in any position of authority here &#40;or most anywhere for that matter&#41;. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10264-->
<!--Post: 10298--><!--Time: 1109881913-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10298"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 12:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;d like to point out that &#34;Mr. Dogcatcher&#34; is innocent until proven guilty.  If he has confessed, it doesn&#39;t matter at this point.  He hasn&#39;t pleaded guilty or been proven to be guilty in court. <BR> <BR>I thought it was weird when I watched the initial press conference wherein the chief announced that &#34;BTK is arrested.&#34;  A &#34;BTK suspect is arrested&#34; would have been more prudent.   <BR> <BR>At any rate, I don&#39;t know enough about the evidence yet to have an opinion whether he&#39;s guilty or not.  <BR> <BR>Ever since the arrest this site has degenerated into a bickering, name-calling, coat-tail riding, ex post facto witch hunt seemingly controlled by some sort of electronic incarnation of mob mentality. <BR> <BR>Someone could write a thesis using &#34;messages to btk&#34; and &#34;feedback to same&#34; threads before and after the arrest. <BR> <BR>Half of you guys, some of whom were rather eloquent in previous posts, sound like you reverted to age 12 over night, or else have shaken off whatever constructs and personas you created while sleuthing and are now suddenly back to normal. <BR> <BR>Go to ebay, &#40;vultures were already there saturday&#41;&#40;search under BTK or Dennis Rader&#41; and you can actually buy some letters &#40;citation form letters and such&#41;signed by Dennis Rader, which you can then wipe your asses with and burn if it makes you feel better.  Or mail it to the jail with polaroids of your jungle of a yard. <BR> <BR>That would be the coolest. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
