<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10348"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 6:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Juno - You really don&#39;t know enough about anything to be of such opinions. By the way - Ex post facto: Lat: After the fact! &#40;Blacks Law Dictionary&#41;Things that make you go Hmmmmmm! Don&#39;t be a hater!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
