<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10349"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 7:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;.........wipe our asses?...........&#34; <BR>LMFAO! <BR>I do like the polaroid idea, though.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10349-->
<!--Post: 10350--><!--Time: 1109905935-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10350"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 7:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Juno, <BR> <BR>I can’t decide whether you’re too PC, or just too funny. <BR> <BR>e.g.: Messages to… <BR> <BR>“Hey BTK, I&#39;m never going to mow my lawn or pick up dog crap in my yard again! Just to spite you.  <BR> <BR>BSA, even though I am an eagle scout,I hate you  <BR> <BR>Lutheran Denomination---I hate you  <BR> <BR>USAF--I hate you  <BR> <BR>KAKE--I hate you  <BR> <BR>Home Depot--I hate you  <BR> <BR>PJ Ken and Barbie--I hate you all” <BR> <BR>OK. I decided. Too funny is the answer! You are beautiful when you’re angry. <BR> <BR> <BR>Normally, would never try to debate with someone who can use the term “ex post facto” in a sentence, but consider this: <BR> <BR>Yes, there has been some regression. I do feel like I’m twelve again – though I did just get out of the pool! <BR> <BR>Yes, Rader is entitled to due process. If he walks, we will all have to move to Argentina to avoid strangulation and/or a libel suit. <BR> <BR>Yes, prison rape is not funny – it’s usually not gay either – and it won’t happen to ConvictD. Poor mythical Bubba, his  &amp;%$#  must be raw! <BR> <BR>Note: I prefer an early onset of Alzheimer’s, which is also not funny, but most apropos for a murdering c&#42;@&amp;s#!ker who has forever pulverized the memories of his victim’s survivors and his own flesh and blood. Lock him in a cell with some slippers, a mattress, a table, King James and a toilet, and HE STILL possess memories to which he has no mother%$@&amp;ing  right! <BR> <BR>OK, About the profanity – sometimes it just helps get me through the day. I hope no one is printing out these posts and reading them at bedtime to their young. <BR> <BR>NO! Belittlement of dog catchers is an American tradition. It’s in the constitution Juno. You’ll have to pry my posts from my dead fingers to stop me! <BR> <BR>No, the posts have not degenerated. They’ve simply not been deleted. Ask Tom about some of the toxic waste he deleted every day. While the cat’s away… As for the mob mentatity, well… let me say how thankful I am that Tom is not a Grand Wizard in the KKK!  <BR> <BR>What’s happening here is organic and not always pretty. Someone probably WILL write their master’s thesis on it… but, they’ll never submit a final draft to the board and they’ll leave the University to work in their uncle’s Chevrolet Dealership because they caught their girlfriend in bed with her ethics prof… Oh… sorry… off topic.  <BR> <BR> <BR>Great post Juno. Keep it real. Stay cool. LolDog <BR> <BR>   <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10350-->
<!--Post: 10351--><!--Time: 1109906291-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10351"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 7:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ahhhhhhhh........... to be 12 again! <BR> <BR>What it be like Juno?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10351-->
<!--Post: 10433--><!--Time: 1109954763-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10433"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 8:46 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->When i said ex post facto witch hunt I meant exactly that....why that made you go &#34;hmmmmmmm&#34; &#40;and then apparently look it up&#41; i do not know. <BR> <BR>I&#39;m not PC <BR> <BR>Yes, some of it &#40;especially the stuff pasted in the post above&#41; was meant to be funny.  I&#39;m glad someone got it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10433-->
<!--Post: 10448--><!--Time: 1109962614-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10448"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 10:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe you stated &#34;I don&#39;t know enough about the evidence to form an opinion&#34; correct? Yet you vent one out, after the fact! Let me guess, you&#39;re a criminal defense lawyer? And by the way - I didn&#39;t need to look up the latin term. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10448-->
<!--Post: 10487--><!--Time: 1109971352-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10487"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 1:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Rocky <BR>I have not seen any of the evidence.  If you have, please fill me in. <BR> <BR>What opinion did I &#34;vent out&#34; after the fact? <BR> <BR>I have not heard any substantiated accounts of confessions &#40;which in and of themselves do not mean someone is guilty&#41;nor what information the alleged confessions may have contained. <BR> <BR>Therefore, I cannot say the guy is guilty.  How hard is that to comprehend?   <BR>Do I think he&#39;s guilty?  More than likely.  <BR>Do I know it for a fact?  No. <BR> <BR>Personally, I think there will be at least one more twist to this.  I&#39;ll wait and see. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10487-->
